WEBVTT

00:45:59.604 --> 00:46:02.146
I believe "... of all the things
human hearts endure,

00:46:02.170 --> 00:46:04.497
how few are those that kings
can cause and cure?"

00:46:04.521 --> 00:46:06.159
So, most of life is not political.

00:46:06.183 --> 00:46:08.212
Most of life is moral, social, relational.

00:46:08.236 --> 00:46:11.130
So that's why I wrote a book
on how to improve relationships,

00:46:11.154 --> 00:46:13.400
because I think that's
where the real action is,

00:46:13.424 --> 00:46:16.062
and that's how we can make
big improvements in our lives

00:46:16.086 --> 00:46:17.248
and the lives around us.

00:46:17.272 --> 00:46:20.966
CA: Let's actually explore that for a bit,
because it's an easy thing to say,

00:46:20.990 --> 00:46:22.591
and I actually happen to agree.

00:46:22.615 --> 00:46:24.324
The pieces I would tack onto that

00:46:24.348 --> 00:46:30.971
is that a lot of what shapes history
is scientific and technological;